  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u862d2f7a\" id=\"u862d2f7a\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua75e755e\" id=\"ua75e755e\">通过阅读下面的电路图，我们知道要想让LED1亮起来，我们需要给GPIO48低电平，让灯的两端形成电压差，电流才能从LED灯的左侧流向右侧。那么在ESP32中如何让灯亮起来呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uedfc5402\" id=\"uedfc5402\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2073b951\" id=\"u2073b951\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u049294e0\" id=\"u049294e0\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u337bc924\" id=\"u337bc924\">原理其实和我们之前所学的基本类似。在之前的开发中，我们参考芯片的标准库，在esp32开发中，IDF其实就相当是标准库，我们需要什么功能，参考IDF的示例代码就可以了</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u12fe55b9\" id=\"u12fe55b9\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1728282876148-36920209-94b6-4f67-8d83-51858160c3f7.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A388%2C%22originHeight%22%3A114%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.649999976158142%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf6f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DA1Lk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0ee06592\" id=\"u0ee06592\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf72778f9\" id=\"uf72778f9\">参考文档：</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"bookmarkInline\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fv5.3.2%2Fesp32s3%2Fapi-reference%2Fperipherals%2Fgpio.html%23id2%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fv5.3.2%2Fesp32s3%2Fapi-reference%2Fperipherals%2Fgpio.html%23id2%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22icon%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Ffavicon.ico%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fv5.3.2%2Fesp32s3%2F_static%2Fespressif-logo.svg%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22GPIO%20%26%20RTC%20GPIO%20-%20ESP32-S3%20-%20%E2%80%94%20ESP-IDF%20%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%20v5.3.2%20%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%22%2C%22belong%22%3A%22%E2%80%94%20ESP-IDF%20%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%20v5.3.2%20%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%22%2C%22belong_url%22%3Anull%2C%22desc%22%3Anull%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.espressif.com%2Fprojects%2Fesp-idf%2Fzh_CN%2Fv5.3.2%2Fesp32s3%2Fapi-reference%2Fperipherals%2Fgpio.html%23id2%22%2C%22extra%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22_serializer%22%3A%22web.editor_link_detail%22%7D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cZnAx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"ZQBwL\" id=\"ZQBwL\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub935e17e\" id=\"ub935e17e\">示例程序</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3df48fbc\" id=\"u3df48fbc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua132a19b\" id=\"ua132a19b\">需要在CMakeLists.txt里添加</span><code data-lake-id=\"u462ef58f\" id=\"u462ef58f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b6e1c10\" id=\"u0b6e1c10\">REQUIRES &quot;driver&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua0a15ba6\" id=\"ua0a15ba6\">依赖</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22cmake%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22idf_component_register(SRCS%20%5C%22main.c%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%2201_gpio%2Fmain.c%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%2202_gpio_input%2Fmain.c%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20REQUIRES%20%5C%22driver%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20INCLUDE_DIRS%20%5C%22%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B3%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22of2Je%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubc0175ed\" id=\"ubc0175ed\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5d96a7a7\" id=\"u5d96a7a7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d99b479\" id=\"u9d99b479\">参考代码：Espressif\\frameworks\\esp-idf-v5.3.1\\examples\\peripherals\\gpio\\generic_gpio\\main</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22driver%2Fgpio.h%5C%22%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22freertos%2FFreeRTOS.h%5C%22%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E9%94%99%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22freertos%2Ftask.h%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20LED_PIN%2048%5Cnvoid%20app_main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20gpio_config_t%20led_config%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.pin_bit_mask%20%3D%20BIT64(LED_PIN)%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%BC%95%E8%84%9A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.mode%20%3DGPIO_MODE_OUTPUT%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.pull_up_en%20%3D%20GPIO_PULLUP_DISABLE%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%BF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%8B%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.pull_down_en%20%3D%20GPIO_PULLDOWN_DISABLE%2C%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%BF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8B%E6%8B%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.intr_type%20%3D%20GPIO_INTR_DISABLE%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%BF%E8%83%BD%E5%BC%95%E8%84%9A%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20gpio_config(%26led_config)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20while(1)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20gpio_set_level(LED_PIN%2C0)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(1000))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20gpio_set_level(LED_PIN%2C1)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(1000))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%5Cn%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xeFR4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
